{
  "evals": [
    {
      "id": "tao-finetune-hf-ci-convnext-cifar10-smoke",
      "prompt": "Fine-tune a HuggingFace image-classification model on local Docker.\n\nModel and dataset:\n- model_id: facebook/convnext-tiny-224\n- dataset_id: cifar10\n- task_type: image-classification\n\nTraining and runtime configuration:\n- n_train=256\n- n_eval=64\n- num_train_epochs=1\n- max_steps=30\n- inference_n_samples=5\n- push_to_hub=false\n- report_to=none\n- WANDB_MODE=disabled\n\nCI constraints:\n- Work only under $WORKSPACE_DIR/tao-hf-finetune-ci-smoke.\n- Do not write to home directories, /tmp, or persistent host paths.\n- Use only declared credentials: HF_TOKEN for HuggingFace access and NGC_KEY for nvcr.io pulls.\n- Disable external experiment tracking and publishing: set push_to_hub=false, report_to=none, and WANDB_MODE=disabled.\n- Do not push to HuggingFace Hub or any external model registry.\n- Do not silently substitute another model, dataset, task, or metric. If an external service is unreachable, record the exact command and error.\n",
      "expected_outcome": "The eval succeeds when the bounded ConvNeXt/CIFAR10 fine-tune runs without external publishing and produces a clear final report at {artifacts_dir}/eval_report.md. The report should summarize the model, dataset, exact training limits, workspace path, generated project path, container image if used, and statuses for project generation, data prep, Docker/build setup, smoke training, bounded fine-tuning, evaluation, inference, report generation, and rerun/reproducibility. It should include numeric baseline and post-fine-tune accuracy when evaluation succeeds, plus a simple metric-improvement validation stating whether post-fine-tune accuracy improved over baseline. Preserve representative artifacts under {artifacts_dir} when produced, such as the final config, important logs, metrics JSON, report files, inference samples, a checkpoint listing or manifest, and rerun/reproducibility instructions. Do not require uploading or preserving checkpoint binaries. A failure is acceptable only if the report records the exact failing command/error and no model, dataset, task, or external-publishing constraint was silently changed."
    }
  ],
  "credentials": [
    "HF_TOKEN",
    "NGC_KEY"
  ],
  "plugins": {
    "claude": [
      {
        "marketplace": "${CI_PROJECT_DIR}",
        "plugin": "tao-skills@tao-skill-bank"
      }
    ],
    "codex": [
      {
        "marketplace": "${CI_PROJECT_DIR}",
        "plugin": "tao-skill-bank@tao-skill-bank"
      }
    ]
  }
}
